{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6ee667926ea7db6105d47b0603acb684d56bcafb775460758d176960d6783731",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddd889341b6e0c1a89409006b712a2cdedc8eb4aa03661ccd1da15a314f8ea85",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦！\n拍摄，全部结束了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:721b17fd73a95e057bb765c70aa17884e89d7753814526f660b6335be741e323",
      "text": "最后，拿到了花朵和玩具！\n朱音的红色！好帅，好酷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bd5ebe4a77be83db5da596166074b7f6c78bbdee2a9b0c077dd6d71a1a05a01",
      "text": "拍摄，虽然结束了……什么时候，还能\n和朱音他们，见面吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dda88d38c2f34bbe14f330b246a98dbfd8c9c4b073e230cda395f66fd56b7c0",
      "text": "一定能见面的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a9bd5eee66b522eb6b3ce1a910e84ca9f3de27ee8e73c3b73d3bbdb51755430",
      "text": "我也想再见\n他们呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2cc9ac4870d66c7688850f2f5478971742ee42bf669cabf523cff4a5b18e802",
      "text": "嗯……！能见到的，绝对！故事的后续，\n也超级期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27a8af5efa119d20abb4d66be35ca27c128a1964ab281cd9e17c3081fa9bb524",
      "text": "制作人也是？好开心！\n大家，肯定也是一样的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b064e1b0ea612cae1674cd4f4ea53b87622de229611a2fe2178489863187bf1a",
      "text": "一边塑造角色，一边打躲避球，好难。\n要像朱音那样，一直动来动去，好辛苦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ec4439b4729b6bd0677be04c4269f788e4e424a531a2ae98c415daf562d67d8",
      "text": "但是我，好开心！制作人，\n陪着我们，大家，都笑得好灿烂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9af99f15f0ca8f029a58a4706dfd4b3dc41841dc4d5cc4149492e72f50b7af55",
      "text": "所以练习，最喜欢了。\n谢谢你，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d7d4d05f94e8afd3920523efb31aa4464ad1a0475a15d88a7f63bed23dbc2c",
      "text": "不客气",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe49b3a5b1f6dddd98013d022e84a5a69020d83a325ccae3900cbc842eb5e4f3",
      "text": "什么时候，还要一起，练习！\n恭二也是，龙也是，凉也是！大家一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:010pie_402_2_4_010_02_09_a:2_4_010_02_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64b75db6a4d5d4d32538418381138ab0e496698caf1e626bb7c6aadd5d765785",
      "text": "在那之前，我……要像朱音那样，\n好好加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
